#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SE2227 expect=violation domain=TS
#note "No TSPARMCD=TRTV record anywhere in TS -> the 'Treatment Vehicle' parameter is missing, one dataset-level finding. Note TRT - a strict prefix of TRTV - is present, so a record for the shorter code must not satisfy the longer one."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1-1
#expectViolationCount 1
dataset TS class="TRIAL DESIGN" label="Trial Summary"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col TSSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col TSPARMCD type=Char label="Trial Summary Parameter Short Name"
col TSPARM   type=Char label="Trial Summary Parameter"
col TSVAL    type=Char label="Parameter Value"
---
S01 | TS | 1 | TRT | Investigational Therapy or Treatment | COMPOUND X
S01 | TS | 2 | TRTCAS | Primary Treatment CAS Registry Number | 50-00-0
S01 | TS | 3 | STITLE | Study Title | 28-Day Repeat Dose Toxicity Study
